{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-06-phl-tickets/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:50:15.851Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"4718e9d20bffde3614ddc4e889ada8d86bf99543add681b30522208c8ed73260","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, here's what I found for Kwame's review. It comes from #coastal-team, #coastal-random and Moss's Coastal notes.\n\n**Pellucid Harbor Logistics (Gulf Coast)**\n- **#4419** is open. The `Yard_Dwell_Summary` report times out when filtered by container length. Source: Moss's Coastal cheat sheet.\n- Moss's cheat sheet also lists chassis pool validation at Gate 4 during shift change as the main friction point. It gives no ticket number for this.\n\n**Driftmoor Marine Freight (Puget Sound)**\n- **Feature request #882** asks for a bulk-clear button for departed barges. Warehouse managers requested it. Source: Moss's Coastal cheat sheet.\n- **#4419** is also logged against Driftmoor. It is a barge slip 7 schedule sync ticket, and Driftmoor wanted a patched manifest CSV before the 06:00 shift. Source: Moss's 2 Nov 2025 digest.\n- The cheat sheet mentions a failed tide-table import macro on Terminal B. Engineering gave the night dispatcher a manual CSV patch. It has no ticket number, and I can't tell whether it is closed.\n\n**Check before the review**\n- **#4419 appears on both accounts with different problems.** One of the two notes probably has the wrong number or account. Kwame or Moss should confirm which.\n- **Not included:** I left out Pellow Home Living (formerly Covey & Lark Retail), including #8812 and PD-4821. I also left out Saltmarsh Provisions' PD-4827 and PD-4824.\n- **Possible extra for Phl:** your own Dec 2025 cutover note mentions PD-8841, chassis pool holds on double-booked gates at Gate 4B. It also mentions a CSV import bug on the Berth 2 yard map. It isn't in the sources you named, so I didn't count it. I can add it if you want.\n- **Gaps:** I can only see what's in those channels and Moss's notes. The account ticket folders aren't visible to me, so the list may not be complete."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
